# ==============================================================================================
#  .gitignore -- AvatarForge
# ==============================================================================================
#  Rule of thumb for this repository: source, documentation and test tooling are tracked; anything
#  that a documented command can regenerate is not. Every ignored directory below is produced by
#  `tools/build_host.sh`, `tools/build_android.sh` or `tools/build_gradle.sh`, and BUILD.md says
#  which command regenerates it.
#
#  Deliberately NOT ignored (tracked, because they are the contract or the evidence of it):
#    abi/afcore.abi.json   the generated ABI manifest is checked in on purpose - the conformance
#                          tool diffs against it, so a change to the header must show up as a diff
#    abi/                  in this repository, not as a silent regeneration
# ==============================================================================================

# ---- host build (tools/build_host.sh) ---------------------------------------------------------
build-host/

# ---- Android native build (tools/build_android.sh) --------------------------------------------
build-android/
build-android-*.log

# ---- Rust (cargo) -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
rust/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# ---- Gradle / Android SDK ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.gradle/
**/build/
local.properties
*.iml
.idea/
captures/
*.hprof

# ---- signing material: never in a repository ----------------------------------------------
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore

# ---- build logs (the commands are documented; the logs are noise) -----------------------------
*.log

# ---- generated binaries -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# The native libraries are built per ABI and per NDK version by tools/build_android.sh, and the
# Gradle build consumes them through -Paf.prebuiltJni. Committing 14 MB of .so files that a
# documented command rebuilds would make every NDK bump a 14 MB diff.
prebuilt/

# The APKs, the SDK AAR and the 34 MB sample export are release outputs, not sources: 51 MB of
# binaries in history forever. Regenerate with
#     tools/build_gradle.sh :app:assembleDebug :app:assembleRelease :sdk:assembleRelease
#     build-host/export_probe artifacts/avatarforge-sample.glb
# If you *do* want a published build tracked, force-add that single file (`git add -f`) rather
# than removing these patterns.
artifacts/*.apk
artifacts/*.aar
artifacts/*.glb
out/

# ---- OS / editor cruft ------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
